OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with trying to    
OL,4,Asteal cufflinks and clock from royal   
OL,5,Ahome                                   
OL,7,FTwo men charged with trespassing at the
OL,8,FPrince and Princess of Wales's country 
OL,9,Fhome are accused of trying to steal    
OL,10,Fcufflinks and a clock.                 
OL,12,FPolice were called to Anmer Hall, on   
OL,13,Fthe Sandringham estate in Norfolk,     
OL,14,Fshortly before 18:00 GMT on Monday     
OL,15,Fafter reports of suspicious activity.  
OL,17,FMirgen Doku, 34, and Arilen Ndoci, 32, 
OL,18,Fboth of no fixed address, have been    
OL,19,Fcharged with entering a dwelling with  
OL,20,Fintent to steal and trespassing on a   
OL,21,Fprotected site.                        
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
