OL,3,GNEWSATwo men charged with trying to    
OL,4,Asteal cufflinks and clock from royal   
OL,5,Ahome                                   
OL,7,FBoth appeared at Norwich Magistrates'  
OL,8,FCourt earlier and have been remanded in
OL,9,Fcustody until a hearing on Monday.     
OL,10,FProsecutors said a third suspect       
OL,11,Fremained at large.                     
